    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please be sure to know</h2>This is a passionate, adrenaline pumping zombie mowing game, with its own story, the story of the game is not yet finished, I will do my best to complete this game in the future, collect opinions, increase the gameplay, and make sure not to disappoint every single one of you players.<br>The current plot of the game has two chapters, about an hour long, 4 characters to choose from, with endless mode and unlimited firepower two modes (more will be launched in the future), for players to start a bloody fight, the game is more decompressed, relax, suitable for leisure time to play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Although this game has a story, there are many imperfections in the story, there are no cutscenes, and the story can not give the player a strong sense of substitution for the time being, so I release it with early access.  Please do not bring a bad shopping experience because of impulse consumption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operating environment and troubleshooting</h2>1. The developers themselves tested that the game could be run trouble-free on a computer that had been reinstalled five years ago and had no software installed, as long as Directx components and C++2015-2022 were installed. The first time players install this game Steam will install these two components for players, if you have such problems please verify this game.<br><br>2. If you still can not solve please try to delete \u300aFireFly\u300b cache files, you need to open windows show hidden files option, C:\\Users\\ your computer name \\AppData\\Local\\FireFly, delete all files in the directory.<br><br>3. If you open the game and you are prompted to update the graphics driver, then you may need to update the graphics driver.<br><br>4. If the above operations still cannot solve the problem, then there may be a problem with your windows system, and you are advised to reinstall the system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i>The game supports Chinese female voice dubbing, there is no male voice dubbing for the time being, I will soon personally dubbing for boys, English dubbing may have to wait, because the author is practicing English.</i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A passionate fight</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/77fd4104f60e336a55216958bdeced80.poster.avif?t=1716859595\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/77fd4104f60e336a55216958bdeced80.webm?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/77fd4104f60e336a55216958bdeced80.mp4?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/aacc1924417e8b573733de2b5bccddf4.poster.avif?t=1716859595\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/aacc1924417e8b573733de2b5bccddf4.webm?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/aacc1924417e8b573733de2b5bccddf4.mp4?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/386fc1ab5c3a650a370bfb22b4fc24e1.poster.avif?t=1716859595\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/386fc1ab5c3a650a370bfb22b4fc24e1.webm?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/386fc1ab5c3a650a370bfb22b4fc24e1.mp4?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/432bd73d80757a46bcd0665f8298805b.poster.avif?t=1716859595\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/432bd73d80757a46bcd0665f8298805b.webm?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626070/extras/432bd73d80757a46bcd0665f8298805b.mp4?t=1716859595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
